@startuml
title CulturaAccesible Lima MVC y procedimientos MySQL 24 octubre 2026
left to right direction
package Navegador {
  [Vista HTML y catalog-view.js] as View
  [CatalogController y ChatController] as Controller
  [CatalogModel] as Model
  Controller --> View : actualiza
  View --> Controller : acciones
  Controller --> Model
}
package "backend-java · Java 17 / Spring MVC" {
  package controlador {
    [ApiController] as API
    [ApiErrors] as Errors
  }
  package modelo {
    [CatalogService] as Service
    interface CatalogStore as Port
    [ChatService y PricingService] as PythonClients
  }
  package vista {
    [ApiView · JSON] as JsonView
  }
  package "infraestructura.jdbc" {
    [CatalogRepository JDBC] as JDBC
    [StoredProcedureExecutor] as Procedures
  }
  API --> Service
  API --> JsonView : representa resultados
  Errors --> JsonView : representa errores
  API --> PythonClients
  Service --> Port
  JDBC ..|> Port
  JDBC --> Procedures : contrato de rutina
}
database MySQL
Model --> API : JSON
Procedures --> MySQL : SimpleJdbcCall con parámetros
package Python {
  [api.routes y api.schemas] as Routes
  [application.services] as UseCases
  [assistant y model] as ML
  Routes --> UseCases
  UseCases --> ML
}
PythonClients --> Routes : HTTP
note bottom of Service
Inversión de dependencias aplicada al catálogo.
Todavía depende de Spring y errores HTTP.
No es una migración completa a Clean Architecture.
end note
@enduml
